{
  "info": {
    "name": "西窗（XiChuang）",
    "description": "一款基于 LangChain + LangGraph + FastAPI 构建的多模态智能交互助手",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "xichuang-server"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-API-Key",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{api_key}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "服务基础地址"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "API Key（如启用鉴权）"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "api",
      "description": "所有 API 接口",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "v1",
          "description": "API v1 版本接口",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "健康检查",
              "description": "系统健康检查、存活探针、就绪探针、版本信息和配置摘要接口。",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "健康检查",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/health",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "health"]
                    },
                    "description": "检查系统各组件的健康状态，包括数据库连接、Milvus 连接、API 配置。\n\n**响应字段：**\n- `status`: 系统整体状态（healthy / unhealthy / degraded）\n- `version`: 应用版本号\n- `timestamp`: 检查时间\n- `checks`: 各组件健康状态映射（database / milvus / api_config）"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "存活探针",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/health/live",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "health", "live"]
                    },
                    "description": "用于 Kubernetes liveness probe，只检查应用是否存活，不检查依赖。\n\n**响应示例：**\n```json\n{\"code\": 200, \"message\": \"success\", \"data\": {\"status\": \"alive\"}}\n```"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "就绪探针",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/health/ready",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "health", "ready"]
                    },
                    "description": "用于 Kubernetes readiness probe，检查所有依赖是否就绪。\n\n**响应字段：**\n- `ready`: boolean，所有依赖是否就绪"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "版本信息",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/version",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "version"]
                    },
                    "description": "返回应用、Python 运行时和主要依赖的版本信息。\n\n**响应字段：**\n- `app`: 应用信息（version, name, description）\n- `python`: Python 版本\n- `fastapi`: FastAPI 版本\n- `environment`: 运行环境"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "配置摘要",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/config/summary",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "config", "summary"]
                    },
                    "description": "返回配置信息（敏感字段已脱敏），仅用于运维排查。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "会话管理",
              "description": "会话 CRUD 操作：创建、查询、更新、删除会话，以及消息管理。",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "会话列表",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations?page=1&page_size=20&keyword=&model_provider=",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations"],
                      "query": [
                        {
                          "key": "page",
                          "value": "1",
                          "description": "当前页码，从 1 开始"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "page_size",
                          "value": "20",
                          "description": "每页大小，最大 100"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "keyword",
                          "value": "",
                          "description": "搜索关键词（匹配标题）",
                          "disabled": true
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "model_provider",
                          "value": "",
                          "description": "按模型提供商筛选",
                          "disabled": true
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "按更新时间倒序返回会话列表，支持分页、关键词搜索和模型提供商筛选。\n\n**查询参数：**\n- `page`: 页码（默认 1）\n- `page_size`: 每页大小（默认 20，最大 100）\n- `keyword`: 搜索关键词（可选）\n- `model_provider`: 模型提供商筛选（可选）"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "创建会话",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"新对话\",\n  \"model_provider\": \"tongyi\"\n}",
                      "options": {
                        "raw": {
                          "language": "json"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations"]
                    },
                    "description": "创建一个新的对话会话。可选指定会话 ID，不提供则自动生成。\n\n**请求体字段：**\n- `id`: 会话ID（可选，不提供则自动生成 UUID）\n- `title`: 会话标题（默认 \"新对话\"）\n- `model_provider`: 模型提供商（默认 \"tongyi\"）\n- `metadata`: 额外元数据（可选）\n\n**可选 provider 值：** `tongyi` / `deepseek` / `glm` / `doubao` / `kimi`"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "会话详情",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversation_id}}",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations", "{{conversation_id}}"]
                    },
                    "description": "获取指定会话的详细信息，包含完整消息列表。\n\n**路径参数：**\n- `conversation_id`: 会话 ID"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "更新会话",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"更新后的标题\",\n  \"summary\": \"会话摘要\",\n  \"model_provider\": \"deepseek\"\n}",
                      "options": {
                        "raw": {
                          "language": "json"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/update",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations", "{{conversation_id}}", "update"]
                    },
                    "description": "更新指定会话的标题、摘要或模型提供商。\n\n**路径参数：**\n- `conversation_id`: 会话 ID\n\n**请求体字段：**\n- `title`: 会话标题（可选）\n- `summary`: 会话摘要（可选）\n- `model_provider`: 模型提供商（可选）\n- `metadata`: 额外元数据（可选）"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "删除会话",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/delete",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations", "{{conversation_id}}", "delete"]
                    },
                    "description": "删除指定会话及其所有消息。此操作不可逆。\n\n**路径参数：**\n- `conversation_id`: 会话 ID"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "保存消息",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"你好\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": \"你好！有什么可以帮助你的吗？\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"clear_existing\": false\n}",
                      "options": {
                        "raw": {
                          "language": "json"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/messages",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations", "{{conversation_id}}", "messages"]
                    },
                    "description": "保存会话消息。如果会话不存在则自动创建。\n\n**路径参数：**\n- `conversation_id`: 会话 ID\n\n**请求体字段：**\n- `messages`: 消息列表，每条包含 `role`（user/assistant/system）和 `content`\n- `clear_existing`: 是否清除现有消息（默认 false，追加模式）"
                  },
                  "response": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "AI 对话",
              "description": "AI 对话接口：标准对话、流式对话、文件上传对话、模型提供商查询。",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "AI 对话（非流式）",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      },
                      {
                        "key": "X-Model-Provider",
                        "value": "tongyi",
                        "description": "可选，通过 Header 指定模型提供商（优先级高于 body）",
                        "disabled": true
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n  \"session_id\": \"test-session-001\",\n  \"query\": \"你好，请介绍一下你自己\",\n  \"history\": [],\n  \"media_inputs\": [],\n  \"use_direct_multimodal\": false,\n  \"provider\": \"tongyi\"\n}",
                      "options": {
                        "raw": {
                          "language": "json"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/message",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations", "message"]
                    },
                    "description": "主对话接口，接收用户输入并返回 AI 回答。支持多模态输入和历史上下文。\n\n**完整流程：**\n1. 解析 provider / media / history\n2. 从 MySQL 加载历史到 in-memory 缓存\n3. 调用 chat_service.handle_chat（LangGraph 状态图编排）\n4. 把 (user + assistant + summary) 写入 MySQL\n5. 返回响应\n\n**请求体字段：**\n- `session_id`: 会话ID（必填）\n- `query`: 用户输入文本（必填，最少 1 字符）\n- `history`: 对话历史（可选）\n- `media_inputs`: 多模态输入列表（可选）\n- `use_direct_multimodal`: 是否直接走多模态模型（默认 false）\n- `provider`: 模型提供方（可选，值：tongyi/deepseek/glm/doubao/kimi）\n\n**Header：**\n- `X-Model-Provider`: 可选，优先级高于 body 中的 provider"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "AI 对话（流式 SSE）",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      },
                      {
                        "key": "X-Model-Provider",
                        "value": "tongyi",
                        "description": "可选，通过 Header 指定模型提供商",
                        "disabled": true
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n  \"session_id\": \"test-session-002\",\n  \"query\": \"用 Python 写一个快速排序\",\n  \"history\": [],\n  \"media_inputs\": [],\n  \"use_direct_multimodal\": false,\n  \"provider\": \"tongyi\"\n}",
                      "options": {
                        "raw": {
                          "language": "json"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/stream",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations", "stream"]
                    },
                    "description": "流式对话接口，通过 Server-Sent Events (SSE) 逐步返回 AI 回答。\n\n**SSE 事件格式：**\n- 正常数据块: `data: {\"content\": \"...\"}`\n- 完成标记: `data: {\"done\": true, \"full_answer\": \"...\"}`\n- 错误信息: `data: {\"error\": \"...\"}`\n\n**注意事项：**\n- 响应 Content-Type 为 `text/event-stream`\n- 流式完成后一次性写库（user + assistant + summary）\n- 请求体字段与非流式接口相同"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "上传文件对话",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "formdata",
                      "formdata": [
                        {
                          "key": "session_id",
                          "value": "test-session-003",
                          "type": "text",
                          "description": "会话ID（必填）"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "query",
                          "value": "描述一下这张图片",
                          "type": "text",
                          "description": "用户文本输入（可选）"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "use_direct_multimodal",
                          "value": "false",
                          "type": "text",
                          "description": "是否直接走多模态模型（默认 false）"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "media_type",
                          "value": "auto",
                          "type": "text",
                          "description": "媒体类型：auto / image / voice / video（默认 auto）"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "file",
                          "value": "",
                          "type": "file",
                          "description": "上传文件（图片/音频/视频，最大 25MB）"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "provider",
                          "value": "tongyi",
                          "type": "text",
                          "description": "模型提供方（可选）"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/upload",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations", "upload"]
                    },
                    "description": "支持上传文件的对话接口（非流式）。上传图片、音频或视频文件后与 AI 对话。\n\n**表单字段：**\n- `session_id`: 会话ID（必填）\n- `query`: 用户文本输入（可选）\n- `use_direct_multimodal`: 是否直接走多模态模型（默认 false）\n- `media_type`: 媒体类型 auto/image/voice/video（默认 auto）\n- `file`: 上传文件（可选，最大 25MB）\n- `provider`: 模型提供方（可选）\n\n**Header：**\n- `X-Model-Provider`: 可选，优先级高于表单中的 provider\n\n**支持的文件类型：**\n- 图片：png, jpg, jpeg, gif, webp\n- 音频：mp3, wav, m4a, ogg, flac\n- 视频：mp4, avi, mov, mkv"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "模型提供商列表",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/providers",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations", "providers"]
                    },
                    "description": "返回当前可用的 AI 模型提供商列表及默认提供商。\n\n**响应字段：**\n- `providers`: 提供商列表，每项包含 name, display_name, model_name, available\n- `default`: 默认提供商名称\n\n**可选提供商：**\n- `tongyi`: 通义千问\n- `deepseek`: DeepSeek\n- `glm`: 智谱 GLM\n- `doubao`: 豆包\n- `kimi`: Kimi / 月之暗面"
                  },
                  "response": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "知识库管理",
              "description": "Milvus 向量数据库管理接口：统计信息、知识库状态、重建知识库、集合管理、向量搜索、数据删除。",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "Milvus 统计信息",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/milvus/stats",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "milvus", "stats"]
                    },
                    "description": "返回 Milvus 连接状态、集合列表及各集合数据量。\n\n**响应字段：**\n- `connected`: 是否已连接\n- `host`: 主机地址\n- `port`: 端口号\n- `collections_count`: 集合数量\n- `collections`: 集合列表（name, num_entities）\n- `error`: 错误信息（连接失败时）"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "知识库状态",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/milvus/knowledge-status",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "milvus", "knowledge-status"]
                    },
                    "description": "获取知识库 / Milvus 构建诊断信息。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "重建知识库",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/milvus/rebuild-knowledge",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "milvus", "rebuild-knowledge"]
                    },
                    "description": "从仓库 README.md 与 data/knowledge/**/*.md 重新向量化并写入集合。\n\n**响应字段：**\n- `success`: 是否成功\n- `message`: 操作消息\n- `collection_name`: 集合名称\n- `inserted_count`: 写入数量"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "列出所有集合",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/milvus/collections",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "milvus", "collections"]
                    },
                    "description": "返回 Milvus 中所有集合的名称列表。"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "集合详情",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/milvus/collections/{{collection_name}}",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "milvus", "collections", "{{collection_name}}"]
                    },
                    "description": "获取指定集合的详细信息，包括字段、索引、实体数量等。\n\n**路径参数：**\n- `collection_name`: 集合名称\n\n**响应字段：**\n- `name`: 集合名称\n- `description`: 集合描述\n- `num_entities`: 实体数量\n- `dimension`: 向量维度\n- `index_type`: 索引类型\n- `metric_type`: 度量类型\n- `fields`: 字段列表"
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "搜索向量数据",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n  \"collection_name\": \"xichuang_knowledge\",\n  \"query_text\": \"什么是 LangGraph？\",\n  \"top_k\": 10,\n  \"output_fields\": [\"text\", \"source\"]\n}",
                      "options": {
                        "raw": {
                          "language": "json"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/milvus/search",
                      "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "milvus", "search"]
                    },
